full-query: "Your company has a set of EC2 instances sitting behind an Elastic Load Balancer. There is a requirement to create an OpsWorks stack to host the newer version of this application. The OpsWorks stack has been created and the current ELB was selected to host the newer version of the application. Now the application is not responding to the requests. What could be the cause?"
